# Sources and per-library flags of the core, for the Makefile build (the
# Makefile sets the platform, the toolchain and what is built in or out).
# The lists are the CMake build's (rpcs3/Emu/CMakeLists.txt,
# rpcs3/libretro/CMakeLists.txt, rpcs3/libretro/libretro_common.cmake and
# 3rdparty/*/CMakeLists.txt): a source added there is added here too.

